# Experiment SOURCES are tracked like any other code. Only generated OUTPUTS
# are ignored: local benchmark runs under experiments/results/, with the
# committed reference results re-included below. CI enforces that no tracked
# file matches an ignore rule.
experiments/results/*
!experiments/results/HELM_ROUTER_VS_VLLM_p50.md
!experiments/results/*.json
!experiments/results/20260316_160248/
